{
    "background_story": "Luis was a skilled butcher and owner of a small, family-run deli in the heart of the city. He took great pride in his work, carefully selecting the finest cuts of meat for his customers. Luis's specialty was his tender and flavorful loin cuts, which he would marinate in a secret blend of herbs and spices passed down from his grandfather. People came from all over to taste his signature loin dishes, from the tender pork loin sandwiches to the mouth-watering beef loin roasts. Luis's attention to detail and commitment to quality made his deli a staple in the community, and his loin cuts the stuff of legend. He was often praised for his ability to make even the toughest cuts of meat tender and delicious, earning him the nickname 'The Loin Master'.",
